Licence notice for tom_binaries

This repository holds compiled programs, not source code. Each program is
built from an open-source package and is licensed under that package's
licence, which is in the package's LICENSE file in its source repository:

| Binary (tom/<platform>/)        | Package                     | Source repository                                  | Licence      |
| ------------------------------- | --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------ |
| buildkit, bk, findproject       | tom_build_kit               | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_basics          | BSD 3-Clause |
| testkit, tk                     | tom_test_kit                | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_devops          | BSD 3-Clause |
| issuekit, ik                    | tom_issue_kit               | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_devops          | BSD 3-Clause |
| tom                             | tom_build_cli               | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_devops          | BSD 3-Clause |
| astgen                          | tom_ast_generator           | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_d4rt            | BSD 3-Clause |
| d4rtgen                         | tom_d4rt_generator          | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_d4rt            | BSD 3-Clause |
| dcli                            | tom_d4rt_dcli               | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_d4rt            | BSD 3-Clause |
| dclie                           | tom_dcli_exec               | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_d4rt            | BSD 3-Clause |
| reflector, reflection_analyzer  | tom_reflector               | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_reflection      | BSD 3-Clause |
| reflectiongenerator             | tom_reflection_generator    | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_reflection      | BSD 3-Clause (Dart authors, derived from reflectable) |
| tom_bs                          | tom_vscode_bridge           | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_vscode          | BSD 3-Clause |
| validate_codespecs              | tom_specs_clitool           | https://github.com/al-the-bear/tom_ai_build        | BSD 3-Clause |
| marktext (launcher script)      | -                           | this repository                                    | BSD 3-Clause (below) |

Each program also contains the code of the packages it depends on (for
example tom_d4rt, MIT; the Dart runtime and pub.dev packages, each under its
own licence). Their licences are those packages' licences; a package's
dependencies are listed in its pubspec.yaml in the source repository.

sqlite_vec/ holds the loadable extension of sqlite-vec by Alex Garcia
(https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec), dual-licensed MIT or Apache-2.0; the
licence texts are in sqlite_vec/LICENSE-MIT and sqlite_vec/LICENSE-APACHE.

